{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Thalassa is an open-world underwater survival adventure where players dive into mysterious oceans, uncover secrets of the deep, and build their path to survival. Swim freely, craft equipment, and discover a living ecosystem filled with beauty and danger.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Deep</strong> \u2013 Swim through vast, realistic underwater environments filled with hidden caves, alien flora, and mysterious ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and Craft</strong> \u2013 Gather resources, craft tools, and build underwater bases to withstand the challenges of the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Together or Alone</strong> \u2013 Experience the adventure in singleplayer or team up with friends in cooperative multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Encounter strange creatures, unravel secrets, and immerse yourself in the mysteries of the ocean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next-Gen Visuals</strong> \u2013 Powered by Unity HDRP, delivering realistic water, lighting, and atmospheric effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the unknown. Face the challenges of the ocean depths, and uncover the secrets that only the abyss dares to keep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022290?t=1768156608","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022290?t=1768156608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/ebec57f6fc955e9a889a3404e3b72ef15ecc54ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768156608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/ebec57f6fc955e9a889a3404e3b72ef15ecc54ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768156608","categories":[{"description"